cored 55.570 points which was good enough for bronze, while Piatrenia scored 54.650 points, dropping her to fifth.  With her Rio gold, MacLennan is the first repeat Olympic champion in the sport. Silver was won by Page, and the bronze medal went to Li."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Of the five Olympic trampoline gold medals awarded in this event since its inception into the Olympic programme in 2000, Canada has two, while Russia, Germany and China, all have one. Canada has earned a medal in the women’s event at every Olympic Games since it has been held, with " [:a {:href "/athletes/91267"} "Karen Cockburn"] " winning a bronze in 2000, and then two silvers (2004, 2008), before MacLennan won back to back golds (2012, 2016)."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Qualifying"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/116816"} "Rosie MacLennan"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CAN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CAN.png"}] "CAN"]] [:td {} "103.130 (3)"] [:td {} "56.465 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/130288"} "Bryony Page"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GBR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GBR.png"}] "GBR"]] [:td {} "100.075 (7)"] [:td {} "56.040 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/129692"} "Li Dan"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CHN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CHN.png"}] "CHN"]] [:td {} "104.075 (2)"] [:td {} "55.885 (3)"] [:td {} [:s